@* Palette button only — modal markup lives in <ThemePicker /> under MainLayout so Bootstrap's
   body-appended backdrop does not sit above the dialog (stacking context from .app-topbar). *@
<button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary border-0" title="Theme"
        data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#themePickerModal">
    <i class="bi bi-palette"></i>
</button>
